      "id": "coding-rules.md",
      "kind": "doc",
      "title": "Coding rules",
      "desc": "- File names are lowercase with hyphens.",
      "headings": [
        {
          "level": 1,
          "text": "Coding rules",
          "line": 1,
          "subagent": false,
          "body": "- File names are lowercase with hyphens. `user-profile.ts`\n- Boolean variables start with `is` or `has`\n- Never swallow an error. Do not add code that only logs and moves on",
          "range": {
            "start": 16,
            "end": 189
          }
        }
      ],
      "contract": null,
      "hash": "0a089d63853712f32e07fd8a686abbfe61de462d"
    },
    {
      "id": "flow.md",
      "kind": "task",
      "title": "Feature work",
      "desc": "Handle one request in the order research → plan → implement → review. When the review has comments, go back to implement.",
      "headings": [
        {
          "level": 1,
          "text": "Feature work",
          "line": 1,
          "subagent": false,
          "body": "Handle one request in the order research → plan → implement → review. When the review has comments, go back to implement.",
          "range": {
            "start": 16,
            "end": 143
          }
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "1. Research",
          "line": 5,
          "subagent": true,
          "body": "For each target file, call [research](research.md) with {{>target}} and receive {{<findings}}. Tools {{+read}}, model {{#fast}}.",
          "range": {
            "start": 180,
            "end": 308
          }
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "2. Plan",
          "line": 9,
          "subagent": false,
          "body": "Call [plan](plan.md) with {{>findings}} and receive {{<plan}}.",
          "range": {
            "start": 322,
            "end": 384
          }
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "3. Implement",
          "line": 13,
          "subagent": false,
          "body": "Call [implement](implement.md) with {{>plan}} and receive {{<changed-files}}.",
          "range": {
            "start": 403,
            "end": 480
          }
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "4. Review",
          "line": 17,
          "subagent": true,
          "body": "Call [review](review.md) with {{>changed-files}} and receive {{<comments}}.",
          "range": {
            "start": 515,
            "end": 590
          }
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "5. If there are comments",
          "line": 21,
          "subagent": false,
          "body": "Call [implement](implement.md) with {{>comments}} and receive {{<changed-files}} again. Repeat until there are no comments.",
          "range": {
            "start": 621,
            "end": 744
          }
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "6. Wrap up",
          "line": 25,
          "subagent": false,
          "body": "Run [wrap-up](wrap-up.md).",
          "range": {
            "start": 761,
            "end": 787
          }
        }
      ],
      "contract": null,
      "hash": "3fa0ff02b7a59adc479cc997135fd8a1efa52ce9"
    },
    {
      "id": "implement.md",
      "kind": "task",
      "title": "Implement",
      "desc": "Take the plan or the comments and change the code. The only task in this flow that writes source.",
      "headings": [
        {
          "level": 1,
          "text": "Implement",
          "line": 1,
          "subagent": false,
          "body": "Take the plan or the comments and change the code. The only task in this flow that writes source.",
          "range": {
            "start": 13,
            "end": 110
          }
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Inputs",
          "line": 5,
          "subagent": false,
          "body": "- plan\n- comments",
          "range": {
            "start": 127,
            "end": 144
          },
          "contract": "in"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Steps",
          "line": 9,
          "subagent": false,
          "body": "Work through the items in the order given. Verify after each item and report it in one line.\nFollow the [coding rules](coding-rules.md). If a change outside the plan is needed, write the reason before doing it.\nWhen everything is done, call [review](review.md) with {{>changed-files}} and receive {{<comments}}; if there are comments, apply them.",
          "range": {
            "start": 156,
            "end": 502
          }
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Outputs",
          "line": 15,
          "subagent": false,
          "body": "- changed-files — one line per changed file: path and what changed\n- comments — what the review left at the end. \"pass\" when there is nothing",
          "range": {
            "start": 520,
            "end": 665
          },
          "contract": "out"
        }
      ],
      "contract": {
        "inputs": [
          "plan",
          "comments"
        ],
        "outputs": [
          "changed-files",
          "comments"
        ]
      },
      "hash": "87a3fe78ae7c4da3dc6770c6940670eb0d274e45"
    },
